V2 -- MUTATION CONTROL on the attack machinery: it must be able to BOTH pass and fail
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  A 1/y relic is the physically motivated one: it is exactly the tail of the RETIRED kernel
  nu = sqrt(1+1/y) -> 1 + 1/(2y), the one Blanchet & Novak 2011 call ruled out.  So this is not an
  arbitrary deformation -- it is the family the framework itself was in until 2026-08-02.
