  [PASS] V2a  MUTATION CONTROL: a tiny relic leaves the margin intact, a large one destroys it   (eps = 1e-12 gives 1.3e-08 of the Saturn bound (margin survives); eps = 1e-3 gives 1.3e+01 of it (margin gone).  The V3 test below is therefore capable of both outcomes and is not passing or failing by construction)

