  is recomputed here from the same published equation and confronted with the SAME delta-g bounds A2a
  used, because a referee will not accept 'the anomalous acceleration' meaning one multipole of it.
  [PASS] V4a  the DHF24 eq-(12) integral is independently re-pinned on the published anchors for THIS kernel   (worst 0.76% vs q(1)=0.094, q(1.5)=0.159, q(2)=0.221 (Desmond+2024 Fig. 1), recomputed here from the paper's equation with no code shared with g04.  So the Q_2 numbers below are not taken on trust from the script under audit)

